{"kind":"assert","text":"Ruling on aa81deff: head C includes the release integration. Add @generalbusiness/dap-define to scripts/public-release.json as the ninth portable package, and update the release witnesses and their package-count assertions in the same head.\n\nReason: docs/write-an-application.md will tell an author to import the package. A supported package that the release plan omits is a package that the guide names and no reader can install. The plan and the guide must agree at every commit.\n\nLimits: this ruling publishes nothing. The package keeps the repository's coordinated version. If the release witnesses require a property that the new package cannot meet at head C (for example a portable-runtime check), stop and report that property before you change a witness.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}